{
  "slug": "uikit-max",
  "name": "Uikit Max",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Reviews UIKit code for modern best practices, covering deprecated APIs, Auto Layout, view controller lifecycle, accessibility, performance, concurrency, and the full iOS 26 overhaul — from iOS 13 through iOS 26.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `uikit-max` (Comprehensively reviews UIKit code for best practices on modern APIs, architecture, and performance).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install uikit-max@claude-community` from `tornikegomareli/UIKit-Agent-Skill`.\n\nAn agent skill that teaches AI coding assistants how to write correct, modern, and performant UIKit code. It covers the full surface of UIKit development from iOS 13 through iOS 26 — deprecated API replacement, the complete iOS 26 UIKit overhaul (Liquid Glass, updateProperties(), automatic Observable tracking, UICornerConfiguration, HDR colors, typed notifications, interruptible transitions, UIGlassEffect, UIScrollEdgeEffect, iPad menu bar, UISplitViewController…",
